      "text": {
        "en": "Most reviewers praise Dr. Jenkins, Dr. Reynolds, Dr. Bushbacher, and technicians like Tara for their warmth and dedication at this North 7th Avenue hospital. While two clients complained about back-area policies and nurse handling, long-time owners express strong trust in the team."
