        "en": "Attentive care for dogs and cats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently note how well the staff look after senior dogs, rescued puppies, and cats during examinations and treatments. One dog owner reported that their pet returned fearful after a back-room ultrasound, whereas most reviewers say even nervous pets feel comfortable."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
