      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear vet explanations with some gaps"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many owners appreciate doctors who listen patiently, explain treatment steps logically, and discuss financial options upfront before procedures. However, a few reviewers felt frustrated by a lack of updates while pets were examined in the back area without owners present."
      }
    }
