        "en": "Does Alta Vista Veterinary Hospital accept walk-in visits?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the hospital accepts walk-ins and urgent daytime cases, though some reviewers note that wait times can stretch to several hours during busy periods."
      },
